---
title: Request / response sequence through miniboxd
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as DaemonClient
    participant A as accept + auth
    participant F as bounded frame<br/>parse JSON
    participant D as dispatch
    participant H as handler + ports<br/>selected adapters

    C->>A: connect Unix socket
    C->>F: one tagged DaemonRequest + newline
    A->>F: authorized stream
    F->>D: typed request
    D->>H: mpsc sender + shared state
    H-->>D: 0..n DaemonResponse
    D-->>C: serialize each response + newline and flush

    Note over C,H: continue while non-terminal<br/>stop on terminal response or channel/socket close
    Note over A: native suite: UID 0 required
    Note over F: maximum frame: 1 MiB
